---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Me | Decky Fx">
  <main class="text-slate-200">

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="mb-12 text-center md:text-left md:flex items-center gap-8">
      <div class="w-24 h-24 bg-gradient-to-tr from-purple-600 to-indigo-500 rounded-2xl mx-auto md:mx-0 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/20">
        DF
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4 md:mt-0">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-white to-slate-400">
          Decky Fiyemonda
        </h1>
        <p class="text-indigo-400 font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-sm mt-1">
          Software Developer & Homelab Enthusiast
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="border-slate-800 my-8" />

    <!-- Bio / Intro -->
    <section class="space-y-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Hey, I'm <strong class="text-slate-200">Decky</strong> (often found online as <em>deckyfx</em>). I'm a developer who enjoys building cross-platform tools, bridging frameworks, and messing around with low-level logic. If it involves handling raw bytes for thermal printers or linking React to desktop frameworks, I'm probably interested.
      </p>
      <p>
        When I'm off the clock, I pivot from writing code to configuring infrastructure—running a dedicated Linux home server, tinkering with local LLMs, and self-hosting services to keep my data in my own hands.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Tech Stack & Focus Areas -->
    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-500"></span> What I Do
      </h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl hover:border-slate-700 transition">
          <h3 class="text-indigo-400 font-semibold mb-2">Development</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-4">Building UI bridges, desktop integrations, and hardware-level application logic.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 rounded text-slate-300">Kotlin / Java</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 rounded text-slate-300">Rust / Dioxus</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 rounded text-slate-300">TypeScript / JS</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl hover:border-slate-700 transition">
          <h3 class="text-indigo-400 font-semibold mb-2">Homelab & AI</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-4">Managing dedicated Linux servers and hosting local, private generative AI models.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 rounded text-slate-300">Docker</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 rounded text-slate-300">CasaOS & Samba</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 rounded text-slate-300">Local LLMs</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Off Duty / Interests -->
    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500"></span> Off-Duty Interests
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
        When I'm not staring at a terminal or debugging compilation errors, you can usually find me doing a few other things:
      </p>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-indigo-500">🎮</span> Handheld gaming & classic RPG randomizers
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-indigo-500">📖</span> Catching up on manga and light novels
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-indigo-500">🍜</span> Hunting down the spiciest local noodles
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-indigo-500">🚲</span> Getting some fresh air on two wheels
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <footer class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-slate-900 text-center">
      <a href="/blog" class="text-sm text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300 inline-flex items-center gap-1 transition">
        Read my blog posts <span class="text-xs">→</span>
      </a>
    </footer>

  </main>
</Layout>
